    "2be7f5ffbe565093e7cc7d6f8d4e699c98c83b5f8b1a5c909da12d7d836c91e2": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "138310f477759b767cd0800c2347d6862be1373b4928633a54d237330f18e34a",
      "contextFingerprint": "933832397bfd66c05f6956fc07a844d74efee0979ffdde0534603c6b00ddc27b",
      "sourceText": "单片机又称[单片微控制器](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%8D%95%E7%89%87%E5%BE%AE%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8/2790468?fromModule=lemma_inlink)，它不是完成某一个逻辑功能的[芯片](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87/32249?fromModule=lemma_inlink)，而是把一个计算机系统集成到一个芯片上。相当于一个微型的计算机，和计算机相比，单片机只缺少了I/O设备。概括的讲：一块芯片就成了一台计算机。它的体积小、质量轻、价格便宜、为学习、应用和开发提供了便利条件。同时，学习使用单片机也是了解[计算机原理](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/1221312?fromModule=lemma_inlink)与结构的最佳选择。",
      "translatedText": "A microcontroller is also called a[single\\-chip microcontroller](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%8D%95%E7%89%87%E5%BE%AE%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8/2790468?fromModule=lemma_inlink)\\. It is not a[chip](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87/32249?fromModule=lemma_inlink)that performs a single logic function; rather, it integrates a complete computer system onto one chip\\. It is equivalent to a microcomputer, and compared with a computer, a microcontroller lacks only the I/O\\. In summary: one chip becomes a computer\\. It is small in size, light in weight, and low in cost, providing convenient conditions for learning, application, and development\\. At the same time, learning to use a microcontroller is also the best choice for understanding[computer principles](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/1221312?fromModule=lemma_inlink)and architecture\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 228,
        "outputTokens": 133,
        "costUsd": 0.000228
      }
    },
